  "body": "Closes #1158\nClaim: cloud/m4q-small-sonnet\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5 (cloud/m4q-small-sonnet)\n\n**Problem.** A group conversation is identified only by the avatar's group icon, hidden from VoiceOver; the visible row no longer says « Interlocuteurs multiples » (#900). Legacy read that text (`MPListView.swift:775-787` @ 87fe0d1c).\n\n**Cause.** `MessageAvatarView` is `.accessibilityHidden(true)` and the combined row carries no group state.\n\n**Change.** `MessageRowView.accessibilityValue(of:)` returns « Conversation de groupe » when `avatarSubject(of:).isGroup`, applied with `.accessibilityValue` on the combined row. The visible row is unchanged (#900).\n\n**Tests.** `MessageRowAvatarTests.groupRowIsSpoken` on the captured `R13u1` list (group and one-to-one rows): fails without the change (no such function). Cloud session: not built here (no Xcode), compile-check requested; VoiceOver on an « MP multiples » row on the next device review (#893).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
